 "int-union": "Same, inside a union: zod 3 picked the integer branch (its int issue did not abort) and reported its two issues; zod 4 reports the union ('Invalid input').",
 "int-safe": "zod 4's .int() is a safe integer: values above 2^53 - 1 are refused (zod 3 accepted them)."
},
